  "text": "STORE\nCOMMUNITY\nABOUT\nSUPPORT\nInstall Steam sign in  |  language\nBrowse\nRecommendations\nCategories\nHardware\nWays to Play\nSpecial Sections\nMore\nAdvanced Search\nAll Games > Indie Games > Path of Idle: Old Gods Rising\nCommunity Hub\nPath of Idle: Old Gods Rising\nA Lovecraftian idle RPG with auto-battles, loot farming, chests, team strategy, town building, gear crafting, Runewords, stages, towers, realms, and seasons. Serve the Old Gods, build your town, corrupt the chosen, and fight for their awakening!\nRECENT REVIEWS:\nVery Positive (132)\nALL REVIEWS:\nMostly Positive (1,252)\nRELEASE DATE:\nAug 13, 2026\nDEVELOPER:\nSmall Mill, Small Mill\nPUBLISHER:\nSmall Mill, Small Mill\nPopular user-defined tags for this product:\nRPGIdlerStrategyAdventureCasualLootIndie+\n\nSign in to add this item to your wishlist, follow it, or mark it as ignored\n\nSingle-player\nSteam Achievements\nSteam Cloud\nFamily Sharing\nLanguages:\n\tInterface\tFull Audio\tSubtitles\nEnglish\t✔\t\t✔\nSimplified Chinese\t✔\t\t✔\nTraditional Chinese\t✔\t\t✔\nGerman\t✔\t\t✔\nTITLE: Path of Idle: Old Gods Rising\nGENRE: Adventure, Casual, Indie, RPG, Strategy\n\nDEVELOPER: Small Mill, Small Mill\nPUBLISHER: Small Mill, Small Mill\nRELEASE DATE: Aug 13, 2026\n\nVisit the website \n Discord \n X \n Bilibili \n QQ \n Douyin \nView update history\nRead related news\nView discussions\nFind Community Groups\nEmbed\n \n \nBuy Path of ldle: old Gods Rising\n$9.99 \nAdd to Cart\nBuy Path of Idle: Old Gods Rising – Founder's Edition BUNDLE (?)\n\nBuy this bundle to get all 2 items!\n\nBundle info\n \nYour Price:\n$11.98\n \nAdd to Cart\nContent For This Game\nBrowse all (1)\nPath of Idle: Old Gods Rising - Supporter Pack\n$1.99\n$1.99 \nAdd all DLC to Cart\n \n \nAbout This Game\n\nAbout the Game\n\nDeeply integrated with the classic features of dark fantasy games, this title delivers a rich gear-building experience.\n\nTailor-made for dark fantasy fans who are tired of intense mechanical operations, it lets you fully enjoy the fun of matching top-tier gear without tedious controls.\n\nGame Background\n\n• You will serve as a servant of the Old God, building a town upon the sealed grounds of Blackreef Isle.\n\n  Grow your cult, expand your influence, and choose those with hidden potential from exiled criminals.\n\n  Awaken their power with the blood of the Old God, transforming them into Godsworn under your command.\n\n  Send the Godsworn to wage war across the world, growing stronger through slaughter and trials.\n\n  At last, step into the Void, defeat the mighty Outer Gods, and reclaim the sealed power.\n\n  When every seal is broken, the sleeping Old God shall rise from the depths of Blackreef Isle.\n\nGame Features\n\nIdle Auto-Battle\n\nFull-auto real-time combat frees your hands completely—sit back and watch valuable loot fill your inventory effortlessly!\n\nSix Unique Classes\n\nEach class boasts an exclusive and one-of-a-kind skill system. Smartly combine skills to unleash devastating combat power.\n\nRobust Gear System\n\nInheriting the essence of multiple dark fantasy games, gears of different rarities each serve a distinct purpose, enabling countless build possibilities.\n\nTown Construction & Upgrade\n\nA variety of town buildings offer rich functional services. Customize upgrades at will to greatly enhance building efficiency.\n\nProgressive Gameplay Modes\n\nFive adventure modes—Expedition, Exploration, Divine Tower, Alternate Dimension, and Finality—unfold in a layered progression, bringing diverse challenge experiences.\n\nSingle-Player Seasonal Challenges (Seasonal content will be gradually added after the launch)\n\nEach season features unique new content with independent save files. You can embark on any seasonal journey at any time.\n\nREAD MORE\nAI Generated Content Disclosure\n\nThe developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:\n\nAbout 10% of this game’s art assets were created with AI-assisted design, including some combat scenes and talent icons. All AI-generated content was reviewed, adjusted, and polished by artists. The remaining art assets were hand-crafted.\n\nSystem Requirements\nWindows\nmacOS\nMINIMUM:\n\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\n\nOS: Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit\n\nPROCESSOR: Intel Core i5-750, 2.67 GHz / AMD A12-9800\n\nMEMORY: 8 GB RAM\n\nGRAPHICS: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7770\n\nDIRECTX: Version 11\n\nSTORAGE: 2 GB available space\nRECOMMENDED:\n\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\n\nOS: Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit\n\nPROCESSOR: Intel Core i5-2300, 2.80 GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 1200\n\nMEMORY: 16 MB RAM\n\nGRAPHICS: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R9 270X\n\nDIRECTX: Version 11\n\nSTORAGE: 2 GB available space\nView all\nWhat Curators Say\n26 Curators have reviewed this product. Click here to see them.\n\n© 2026 Valve Corporation. All rights reserved. All trademarks are property of their respective owners in the US and other countries.\nVAT included in all prices where applicable.\n\nSTEAM\nAbout Steam\nSteam SSA\nSteamworks\nSteam Distribution\nGift Cards\nVALVE\nAbout Valve\nJobs\nHardware\nRecycling\nLEGAL\nPrivacy\nAccessibility\nNotices & Policies\nCookies\nRefunds\nMORE\nGet Steam\nGet Mobile Apps\nGet Support\nMy Account",
